													</span>
												<a class="elementor-toggle-title" tabindex="0">What are the main limitations of Selection Sort ?</a>
					</div>

					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1286" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="6" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1286"><p>The main limitations of Selection Sort are its relatively poor time complexity for large datasets (O(n^2)) and its lack of adaptability to the existing order of data.</p></div>
